meta {
  name: saveEtimFeatureValue
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveEtimFeatureValue",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "etim_class_type": "REGULAR",
      "etim_release": "ETIM-10.0",
      "etim_feature_code": "EF000003",
      "numeric_value": 230
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Set a single ETIM feature value on a product. The product must already have an ETIM classification set for the given type and release.

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `product_id` | integer (nullable) | no | Internal product ID; required unless external_product_id is supplied |
  | `external_product_id` | string (nullable) | no | External product ID; required unless product_id is supplied |
  | `etim_class_type` | string | no | ETIM class type: REGULAR or MODELLING |
  | `etim_release` | string | no | ETIM release (e.g. "ETIM-9.0"). Use "DYNAMIC" for MODELLING type |
  | `etim_feature_code` | string | no | ETIM feature code to set (e.g. "EF000001") |
  | `port_code` | integer | no | Port code for MODELLING class features; defaults to 0 for REGULAR |
  | `not_applicable` | boolean | no | Mark this feature as not applicable for this product |
  | `etim_value_code` | string (nullable) | no | Alphanumeric (A-type) feature value code (e.g. "EV000001") |
  | `numeric_value` | number (nullable) | no | Numeric (N-type) feature value |
  | `logical_value` | boolean (nullable) | no | Logical (L-type) feature value: true or false |
  | `range_min` | number (nullable) | no | Range (R-type) minimum value |
  | `range_max` | number (nullable) | no | Range (R-type) maximum value |
  | `coordinate_x` | number (nullable) | no | Coordinate (C-type) X value |
  | `coordinate_y` | number (nullable) | no | Coordinate (C-type) Y value |
  | `coordinate_z` | number (nullable) | no | Coordinate (C-type) Z value |
  | `value_details` | object[] (nullable) | no | Per-language value details for A-type features (ETIM xChange EtimValueDetails); only stored together with etim_value_code. Languages not listed are left unchanged |

  **Example: Numeric value (N-type)**. Provide numeric_value for N-type features.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveEtimFeatureValue",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "etim_class_type": "REGULAR",
      "etim_release": "ETIM-10.0",
      "etim_feature_code": "EF000003",
      "numeric_value": 230
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_id": 123,
    "etim_feature_code": "EF000003",
    "etim_feature_type": "N",
    "etim_class_type": "REGULAR",
    "etim_release": "ETIM-10.0",
    "numeric_value": 230,
    "etim_value_code": null,
    "logical_value": null,
    "not_applicable": false
  }
  ```

  **Example: Value code (A-type)**. Provide etim_value_code for A-type features.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveEtimFeatureValue",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "etim_class_type": "REGULAR",
      "etim_release": "ETIM-10.0",
      "etim_feature_code": "EF000006",
      "etim_value_code": "EV000001"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_id": 123,
    "etim_feature_code": "EF000006",
    "etim_feature_type": "A",
    "etim_class_type": "REGULAR",
    "etim_release": "ETIM-10.0",
    "numeric_value": null,
    "etim_value_code": "EV000001",
    "logical_value": null,
    "not_applicable": false
  }
  ```

  **Example: Mark not applicable**. Set not_applicable=true to explicitly mark a feature as not applicable.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveEtimFeatureValue",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "etim_class_type": "REGULAR",
      "etim_release": "ETIM-10.0",
      "etim_feature_code": "EF000003",
      "not_applicable": true
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_id": 123,
    "etim_feature_code": "EF000003",
    "etim_feature_type": "N",
    "etim_class_type": "REGULAR",
    "etim_release": "ETIM-10.0",
    "numeric_value": null,
    "etim_value_code": null,
    "logical_value": null,
    "not_applicable": true
  }
  ```

  **Example: Alphanumeric value with value details (A-type)**. value_details holds the manufacturer-specific explanation of the chosen value per language (ETIM xChange EtimValueDetails). It is only stored next to etim_value_code; an empty string removes a language.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveEtimFeatureValue",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "etim_class_type": "REGULAR",
      "etim_release": "ETIM-10.0",
      "etim_feature_code": "EF000007",
      "etim_value_code": "EV000202",
      "value_details": [
        {
          "language": "nl-NL",
          "value_details": "Poolwit"
        },
        {
          "language": "en-GB",
          "value_details": "Polar white"
        }
      ]
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_id": 123,
    "etim_feature_code": "EF000007",
    "etim_feature_type": "A",
    "etim_class_type": "REGULAR",
    "etim_release": "ETIM-10.0",
    "etim_value_code": "EV000202",
    "numeric_value": null,
    "logical_value": null,
    "not_applicable": false,
    "value_details": [
      {
        "language": "en-GB",
        "value_details": "Polar white"
      },
      {
        "language": "nl-NL",
        "value_details": "Poolwit"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
